                  Parameters for Dual3D
                  *******************

START OF PARAMETERS:
data.dat                         -file with data
1   2   0    3                   -   columns for X, Y, Z, var
-1.0e21   1.0e21                 -   trimming limits
0                                -option: 0=grid, 1=jackknife
data.dat                         -file with jackknife data
1   2   0    3                   -   columns for X,Y,Z,vr
0                                -debugging level: 0,1,2,3
dual3d.dbg                       -file for debugging output
dual3d.out                       -file for kriged output
10   0.5   5.0                   -nx,xmn,xsiz
10   0.5   5.0                   -ny,ymn,ysiz
1    0.5   1.0                   -nz,zmn,zsiz
0    5.0                         -0=SK,1=OK
1    0.2                         -nst, nugget effect
1    0.8  0.0   0.0   0.0        -it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
         10.0  10.0  10.0        -a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
